# Alhammarret's Archive and Thought Reflection, both Bot1's, both replace each of its draws outside the first of its draw
# step; Bot1 chooses which applies first (CR 616.1, both cards' rulings), and whichever it is, the other then replaces each of
# the two cards it draws (CR 614.5): four cards a draw. Thought Reflection comes on turn 1 and doubles the turn 3 draw, which
# brings Ancestral Recall; Archive comes on turn 3. In the turn 5 draw step the draw for the turn is the first card of the
# step, so the Archive leaves it alone and Thought Reflection makes it two: the first of these is the step's first card and
# is drawn, the Archive doubles the second - three cards. Ancestral Recall's three draws then are four cards each, with
# the Archive put first, then Thought Reflection, then the Archive again: twelve. Bot1's hand ends at fourteen.

[Bot1 Deck]
